	</tbody>
</table>

<ul>
	<li>Sensitivity = A / (A + C)</li>
	<li>Specificity = D / (D + B)</li>
	<li>Positive Predictive Value = A / (A + B)</li>
	<li>Negative Predictive Value = D / (C + D)</li>
	<li>Positive Likelihood Ratio = sensitivity / (1 – specificity) </li>
	<li>Negative Likelihood Ratio = (1 – sensitivity) / specificity </li>
	<li>Number needed to treat (NNT) = 1 / (absolute risk reduction)</li>
</ul>
